{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"USN-8681-1","published":"2026-08-26T01:40:39Z","modified":"2026-08-26T17:45:03.281055732Z","related":["UBUNTU-CVE-2026-46917","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-46968","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47010","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47021","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47027","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47059","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47063","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-60147"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-41254","CVE-2026-46917","CVE-2026-46968","CVE-2026-47010","CVE-2026-47021","CVE-2026-47027","CVE-2026-47059","CVE-2026-47063","CVE-2026-60147","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-41254","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-46917","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-46968","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47010","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47021","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47027","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47059","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47063","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-60147"],"summary":"openjdk-25 vulnerabilities","details":"It was discovered that the JSSE component of OpenJDK 25 did not correctly\nauthenticate users. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to read or\nmodify sensitive data. (CVE-2026-46968)\n\nIt was discovered that the JSSE component of OpenJDK 25 did not correctly\nauthorize users. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a\ndenial of service. (CVE-2026-46917)\n\nIt was discovered that the ImageIO component of OpenJDK 25 did not correctly\nauthorize users. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to read or\nmodify sensitive data. (CVE-2026-47010)\n\nIt was discovered that the 2D component of OpenJDK 25 did not correctly\nauthorize users. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a\ndenial of service. (CVE-2026-47021, CVE-2026-47059)\n\nIt was discovered that the Libraries component of OpenJDK 25 did not correctly\nauthorize users. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a\ndenial of service. (CVE-2026-47027)\n\nIt was discovered that the Security component of OpenJDK 25 did not correctly\nauthenticate users. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to read or\nmodify sensitive data. (CVE-2026-60147)\n\nIt was discovered that the Libraries component of OpenJDK 25 did not correctly\nauthenticate users. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to read or\nmodify sensitive data. (CVE-2026-47063)\n\nLian Owen discovered that the 2D (Little CMS) component of OpenJDK 25 did not\ncorrectly handle certain integer arithmetic. An attacker could possibly use\nthis issue to cause a denial of service. (CVE-2026-41254)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"openjdk-25","ecosystem":"Ubuntu:22.04:LTS","purl":"pkg:deb/ubuntu/openjdk-25?arch=source&distro=jammy"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"25.0.4+7-1~22.04"}]}],"versions":["25+36-1~22.04.2","25.0.1+8-1~22.04","25.0.2+10-1~22.04","25.0.3+9-2~22.04.2"],"ecosystem_specific":{"availability":"No subscription required","binaries":[{"binary_name":"openjdk-25-demo","binary_version":"25.0.4+7-1~22.04"},{"binary_name":"openjdk-25-jdk","binary_version":"25.0.4+7-1~22.04"},{"binary_name":"openjdk-25-jdk-headless","binary_version":"25.0.4+7-1~22.04"},{"binary_name":"openjdk-25-jre","binary_version":"25.0.4+7-1~22.04"},{"binary_name":"openjdk-25-jre-headless","binary_version":"25.0.4+7-1~22.04"},{"binary_name":"openjdk-25-jre-zero","binary_version":"25.0.4+7-1~22.04"},{"binary_name":"openjdk-25-source","binary_version":"25.0.4+7-1~22.04"},{"binary_name":"openjdk-25-testsupport","binary_version":"25.0.4+7-1~22.04"}]},"database_specific":{"cves_map":{"cves":[{"id":"CVE-2026-46917","severity":[{"score":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:L","type":"CVSS_V3"},{"score":"medium","type":"Ubuntu"}]},{"id":"CVE-2026-46968","severity":[{"score":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:H/A:N","type":"CVSS_V3"},{"score":"medium","type":"Ubuntu"}]},{"id":"CVE-2026-47010","severity":[{"score":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:L/A:N","type":"CVSS_V3"},{"score":"medium","type":"Ubuntu"}]},{"id":"CVE-2026-47021","severity":[{"score":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:L","type":"CVSS_V3"},{"score":"medium","type":"Ubuntu"}]},{"id":"CVE-2026-47027","s